{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_001_archetype_integration_tests_tasks_binding_properties_subfixtures", "label": "Binding-properties sub-fixtures (external-binding-{default,list,map,mutable,validated}-only)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/001-archetype-integration-tests/tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One fixture per binding-properties sub-module so each binding variant is exercised independently; external-binding-validated-only requires enable_default_binding_external_properties=true per the DEPENDS_ON rule in property-binding-properties.xml."}, {"id": "specs_001_archetype_integration_tests_tasks_json_contract_renaming", "label": "Scenario rename: json-contract to custom-attributes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/001-archetype-integration-tests/tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The JSON-contract generation path was removed from the archetype (amendment flag-contrato-absoluto-obsoleta, 2026-10-23); the scenario now exercises the shape carried by custom_entity_attributes_list, a flag that remains in the catalog; enable_json_entity_contracts and absolute_path_jsonfile_contract no longer exist and no manual path substitution is needed at run time."}, {"id": "specs_001_archetype_integration_tests_tasks_manual_validation_checklist", "label": "T030-T032 manual validation checklist (outside the automated suite)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/001-archetype-integration-tests/tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Regression-bait, offline-runnable and dependency-rule checks stay manual: automation would require mutating production source or a fixture that intentionally violates FR-004; the existing fixtures prove the dependency rule by induction \u2014 none 